        "subject": "LU-17000 mdt: drop a dead object check in mdt_lvbo_fill()",
        "message": "LU-17000 mdt: drop a dead object check in mdt_lvbo_fill()\n\nout_put: is reached only after mdt_object_find() has returned a valid\nobject, so obj is neither NULL nor an error pointer there and the\nguard on mdt_object_put() is dead.  Every exit that can run with obj\nunset goes to out: instead, which does not put the object.\n\nReported by smatch as \"variable dereferenced before check 'obj'\".\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:Opus-5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: Ib2385db38c0f2b7807cad6020ee6e69db1e211aa\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/68506\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Arshad Hussain <arshad.hussain@aeoncomputing.com>\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
